        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is it?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War Chess is the first ever chess variant to feature a battle royale style of gameplay, with no limit to how many people can join!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Content</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many different enemies controlled by unique AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Battle against Bosses, and endless waves of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many other weird and interesting features like Conways Game of Life as an enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.poster.avif?t=1772038313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.webm?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.mp4?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extra</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you are new to chess, there is a tutorial, and an easy-to-understand highlighting system to guide you as to where you can move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.poster.avif?t=1772038313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.webm?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.mp4?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What is it?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War Chess is the first ever chess variant to feature a battle royale style of gameplay, with no limit to how many people can join!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Content</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many different enemies controlled by unique AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Battle against Bosses, and endless waves of enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Many other weird and interesting features like Conways Game of Life as an enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.poster.avif?t=1772038313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.webm?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/32e059f859dc91da43009874c3e51364.mp4?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Extra</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you are new to chess, there is a tutorial, and an easy-to-understand highlighting system to guide you as to where you can move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.poster.avif?t=1772038313\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.webm?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4023100/extras/1714f1fdf2811abdbc77debaaeb26206.mp4?t=1772038313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
